  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently to enter free look mode you press Tab once and to exit you just start moving.\n\nThis how has some weird quirks to it:\n\n- When enabling free look while walking, you can only disable it by standing still for a second. \n\n- Pressing Tab while already being in free look and walking results in the character snapping into your current view direction.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe free look enter / exit mechanic should be reworked to be more consistent. \n\n**There are 2 ways I could see this being done:**\n\n1. Toggle Free Look: In this mode you would just press the button to toggle free look on / off.\n\n2. Hold Free Look: In this mode you would have to hold the button to be in free look, once you let go you would automatically exit it again.",
